{"state": {"subject": "i know the face , but . . .", "body": "well well well !\nelanyi he\nthe english laws punish vice the chinese laws do more , they reward virtue .\nbetter build schoolrooms for ' ' the boy , ' ' than cells and gibbets for ' ' the man . ' ' all concord ' s born of contraries .\noh , what a bitter thing it is to look into happiness through another man ' s eyes .\none who has imagination without learning has wings without feet .\nto lead people walk behind them .\nreal life seems to have no plots . an effective human being is a whole that is greater than the sum of its parts . egotism is the source and summary of all faults and miseries .\ntalk well of your friends and of your enemies say nothing .\nhope has a good memory , gratitude a bad one . nobody told me how hard and lonely change is . in the world of the celebrity , the hierarchy of publicity has replaced the hierarchy of descent and even of great wealth .\nsome people have just enough imagination to spoil their judgment . if i were two - faced , would i be wearing this one ?\nwe cannot direct the wind but we can adjust the sails .\nan argument is like a country road , you never know where it is going to lead . no great advance has ever been made in science , politics , or religion , without controversy ."}, "questions": {"is_spam": {"type": "noul", "instructions": "Is this email unsolicited spam or bulk marketing?"}}, "expected": {"is_spam": true}, "tags": ["enron_spam", "id:7013", "t3arm:train"], "language": "en"}
