{"state": {"subject": "re : master firm agreements", "body": "attention deal compliance and deal validation :\nnew procedure ! !\npursuant to jeff hodge ' s email below , effective tuesday , november 6 , for all counterparties with both a master firm contract and a gisb , all firm deals ( eol and telephonic ) , regardless of length ( including one day deals ) should be attached to the master firm contract . with respect to eol deals , profile manager has been updated to accommodate this change . for counterparties with only a gisb as a master , you may continue attaching firm deals up to one month in duration .\njeff ,\npursuant to your message below , i have updated eol profile manager as follows :\ncounterparty remove gisb add master firm\nconsolidated energy solutions , inc . 96029232 96002347\nequitable gas company 96029557 96003499\nicc energy corporation 96028949 96000633\ninnovative gas services , inc . 96021962 96003168\nmirant americas energy marketing , l . p . 96029028 96001565\nmorgan stanley capital group inc . 96028966 96028965\nquestar energy trading company 96029033 96001878\ntotalfina gas wallumrod , ellen\ncc : kitchen , louise ; dickson , stacy e .\nsubject : master firm agreements\nstacey and ellen :\nin light of current circumstances , if a counterparty has both a master firm and a gisb , please confirm all firm physical transactions ( both telephonic and eol ) under the master firm and not the gisb .\nadditionally , could one of you provide me a list of eol counterparties who have a gisb contract listed as their master agreement for eol ."}, "questions": {"is_spam": {"type": "noul", "instructions": "Is this email unsolicited spam or bulk marketing?"}}, "expected": {"is_spam": false}, "tags": ["enron_spam", "id:18812", "t3arm:train"], "language": "en"}
{"state": {"subject": "re : important - prc mtg", "body": "hi dorn & john , as you discovered recently , i am still ' officially ' in vince\nkaminski ' s group ( my original enron corp . group ) . this holds true for shalesh\nganjoo as well . i did not explicitly pick dorn or john as reviewers thinking\nthat they will show up automatically as a result of my assumed reporting\nstructure .\nso , vince has agreed to ' host ' the review in his group and proceed to\ntransfer me over to ebs officially when this quarter is overs ( apprently that\nwas scheduled to be automatic ) . in the mean time , vasant , stinson or vince\nwould like to get a e - mail from either dorn or john regarding my performance\nfrom their perspective for consideration as soon as possible .\ni had plan on being on vacation starting tomorrow and have made arrangement\nwith my family already . since i am not reviewing shalesh directly ( since he\nis in research under stionson ) , i am assuming i don ' t have to attend the\nreview meetin tommorrow . i ' ll be on the road starting in the morning . if i\nchange this , i am told at home , that i will be in the market for another\nfamily ! i can phone in if that is okay .\nkayla , could you page me with the details ?"}, "questions": {"is_spam": {"type": "noul", "instructions": "Is this email unsolicited spam or bulk marketing?"}}, "expected": {"is_spam": false}, "tags": ["enron_spam", "id:18818", "t3arm:train"], "language": "en"}
