{"state": {"subject": "how about your good self ?", "body": "good evening .\nall our final decisions are made in a state of mind that is not going to last . the vitality of a new movement in art must be gauged by the fury it arouses .\nthe man who has accomplished all that he thinks worthwhile has begun to die . when you are aspiring to the highest place , it is honorable to reach the second or even the third rank .\nthere is a fellowship more quiet even than solitude , and which , rightly understood , is solitude made perfect . frustrated love has been the incentive for many great works .\nspinoza experience keeps a dear school , but fools will learn in no other .\nhave an aim in life - - then don ' t forget to pull the trigger . all bodies are slow in growth but rapid in decay .\nour true destiny is not to be ministered unto but to minister to ourselves and to our fellow men . one must verify or expel his doubts , and convert them into the certainty of yes or no . the gambling known as business looks with severe disfavor on the business known as gambling .\nnone of us can stand other people having the same faults as ourselves .\n' tis the old secret of the gods that they come in low disguises .\nthe more anger towards the past you carry in your heart , the less capable you are of loving in the present .\nif you find a path with no obstacles , it probably doesn ' t lead anywhere .\nhappiness is not a state to arrive at , rather , a manner of traveling .\ncharity is injurious unless it helps the recipient to become independent of it . i ' ve got to keep breathing . it ' ll be my worst business mistake if i don ' t .\nthe dog that trots about finds a bone .\nhistory is just the portrayal of crimes and misfortunes . civilization is a limitless multiplication of unnecessary necessities . god always has another custard pie up his sleeve .\nthe itch of disputing is the scab of the churches .\nwhen you ' ve got something to prove , there ' s nothing greater than a challenge .\nniganisabye - bye"}, "questions": {"is_spam": {"type": "noul", "instructions": "Is this email unsolicited spam or bulk marketing?"}}, "expected": {"is_spam": true}, "tags": ["enron_spam", "id:23162", "t3arm:train"], "language": "en"}
